'' B-objects-2, RUN: '+=', '*=', '\=', 'shl=', '^=' and the rest over get/set properties --
'' plain, double, indexed, a byref setter, an implicit-this one inside a method, and a
'' receiver with a side effect. 'b.Size += 2' segfaulted. fbc-modern 1.20 refuses the
'' statement (error 9); the expected output is fbc-modern's for the same program written
'' 'p->Size = p->Size + 10', with the receiver and the index evaluated once into locals.
